# Lead App — Loan Origination Customer Portal

A production-grade, JSON-driven Loan Origination Customer Portal. All loan forms render dynamically from a `LoanProduct` JSON configuration — nothing is hardcoded.

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Library | Version |
|-------|---------|---------|
| Framework | Next.js (App Router) | 15.3.3 |
| Language | TypeScript strict mode | 5.x |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS | v3 |
| UI Primitives | Radix UI + custom Shadcn-style components | — |
| Forms | React Hook Form + Zod | RHF 7, Zod 3 |
| Server state | TanStack Query | v5 |
| Client state | Zustand (persisted) | v5 |
| HTTP | Axios | — |
| File upload | react-dropzone | — |
| Toasts | sonner | — |
| Icons | lucide-react | — |

**Node.js:** v22 installed via Homebrew at `/usr/local/opt/node@22/bin`. Always prefix commands with:
```bash
export PATH="/usr/local/opt/node@22/bin:$PATH"
```

## Folder Structure

```
src/
├── app/                        # Next.js App Router pages
│   ├── auth/login/page.tsx
│   ├── auth/register/page.tsx
│   ├── dashboard/page.tsx
│   ├── applications/page.tsx
│   ├── profile/page.tsx
│   ├── loan-application/
│   │   ├── new/page.tsx        # Start new application
│   │   └── [id]/page.tsx       # Resume draft
│   ├── layout.tsx
│   ├── providers.tsx           # QueryClient + Toaster
│   └── globals.css
│
├── components/
│   ├── ui/                     # Reusable UI primitives (Button, Card, Input…)
│   └── forms/                  # Form engine components
│       ├── DynamicField.tsx    # Renders any field type from JSON
│       ├── DynamicSection.tsx  # Renders a section (supports repeatable)
│       ├── DynamicForm.tsx     # Full form from a FormTemplate
│       └── FileUploadField.tsx # Drag-drop upload with progress
│
├── features/
│   ├── auth/                   # LoginForm, RegisterForm
│   ├── dashboard/              # DashboardPage
│   ├── profile/                # ProfilePage (tabs: Personal, Contact, Security)
│   └── loan-application/       # FormWizard, WizardStep, WizardProgress, ReviewScreen
│
├── layouts/
│   └── AppLayout.tsx           # Top navbar + mobile drawer (wraps dashboard pages)
│
├── services/
│   ├── auth.service.ts         # login, register, logout, getProfile, updateProfile
│   ├── application.service.ts  # getApplications, saveDraft, submitApplication
│   └── mock-data.ts            # MOCK_USER, MOCK_APPLICATIONS, LOAN_FORM_TEMPLATES
│
├── store/
│   ├── auth.store.ts           # Zustand: { user, isAuthenticated, setUser, logout }
│   └── wizard.store.ts         # Zustand: wizard drafts, step state, formData
│
├── types/index.ts              # All TypeScript types (FormTemplate, FormField, etc.)
├── utils/schema-builder.ts     # Dynamic Zod schema from FormTemplate JSON
└── lib/
    ├── utils.ts                # cn(), formatCurrency(), getPasswordStrength(), etc.
    ├── axios.ts                # Axios instance with auth interceptors
    └── query-client.ts         # TanStack QueryClient singleton
```

## Available Routes

| Route | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| `/` | Redirects to `/auth/login` |
| `/auth/login` | Login (demo: demo@example.com / Password@123) |
| `/auth/register` | Registration with password strength |
| `/dashboard` | Summary cards + recent applications |
| `/applications` | All applications list |
| `/profile` | User profile with 3 tabs |
| `/loan-application/new` | Start a new loan wizard |
| `/loan-application/[id]` | Resume a draft wizard |

## Dev Commands

```bash
npm run dev       # Start dev server (localhost:3000)
npm run build     # Production build
npm run lint      # ESLint
```
